! Vowels
"ʔ:0 in preceding s"
!! **@RULENAME@**
 ʔ:0 <=> s [%< | %^√: ] _ u %< ;
!! ʔəɬəd+V+Prf+Der+Der/N+N+Sg+PxSg2: __eat/syödä__
!!€ ad<s<ʔu<ʔəɬəd
!!€ ad<s<0u<ʔəɬəd
      [ ƛ̕ | t ] u: %< _ a s %< ;
  %^Red12323:  %{p6%}: %{p5%}: %{p4%}: %{p3%}: %{p2%}: %{p1%}: (%{pØ%}:) _ Vow: [ Lts | » ]* ; ! see Cns:0 in reduplication 3 and 5
!!

"u:0 in preceding ƛ̕"
!! **@RULENAME@**
 u:0 <=> [ ƛ̕ | t ] _ %< ʔ: a s ;


